<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.css" />
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= pageTitle %></title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        bgBase: '#fdfbf7', // Màu kem nền nã hơn
                        main: '#544A47', 
                        accent: '#BA2636',
                        gold: '#C5A059' // Thêm màu vàng sang trọng
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        serif: ['Georgia', 'serif'] // Font chữ có chân cho tiêu đề
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-bgBase text-main font-sans antialiased selection:bg-accent selection:text-white">

    <header class="fixed top-0 w-full bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 transition-all duration-300 border-b border-gray-100">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 h-[80px] flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/" class="w-[140px] hover:opacity-80 transition">
                <img src="https://static.kyotokimonorental.com/app/img/common/logo.svg" alt="Logo">
            </a>
            <div class="hidden md:flex gap-8 font-medium text-sm tracking-wide">
                <a href="#plans" class="hover:text-accent transition">GÓI KIMONO</a>
                <a href="#gallery" class="group flex items-center ...">
                    <span class="text-xl">📸</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-gray-600 group-hover:text-accent text-sm md:text-base">Thư viện ảnh</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/admin" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-main transition">ADMIN</a>
            </div>
            <a href="/booking-step1" class="bg-accent text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg ...">
    ĐẶT LỊCH NGAY
</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="relative w-full h-[600px] md:h-[700px]">
        
        <div class="swiper mySwiper w-full h-full">
            <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                <div class="swiper-slide relative">
                    <img src="<%= heroImage || 'https://static.kyotokimonorental.com/app/img/top/hero/autumn/vi/sp/hero01.webp' %>" 
                         class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="swiper-slide relative">
                    <img src="https://static.kyotokimonorental.com/app/img/top/hero/autumn/vi/sp/hero05.webp" 
                         class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="swiper-slide relative">
                    <img src="https://static.kyotokimonorental.com/app/img/top/hero/autumn/vi/sp/hero08.webp" 
                         class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none">
            <div class="text-center text-white p-5 animate-fade-in-up pointer-events-auto">
                <span class="block text-gold font-serif text-xl mb-4 italic tracking-wider drop-shadow-md">Trải nghiệm văn hóa Nhật Bản</span>
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-7xl font-bold font-serif leading-tight mb-6 drop-shadow-lg">
                    Vẻ Đẹp Truyền Thống <br> Trong Tầm Tay Bạn
                </h1>
                
                <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 mb-8 text-sm md:text-base font-medium">
                    <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur px-4 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/30">✨ 20,000+ Bộ Kimono</span>
                    <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur px-4 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/30">🏯 8 Cửa hàng toàn quốc</span>
                </div>

                <a href="#plans" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-accent px-10 py-4 font-bold text-white transition-all hover:bg-red-700 hover:ring-4 hover:ring-red-200">
                    <span>KHÁM PHÁ NGAY</span>
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
                    </svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="py-6 md:py-10 bg-white border-b border-gray-100 shadow-sm sticky top-[80px] z-40">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:flex md:flex-wrap md:justify-center gap-3 md:gap-4">
                <a href="#plans" class="group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 md:py-3 rounded-full border border-gray-200 hover:border-accent hover:bg-red-50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
                    <span class="text-xl">👘</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-gray-600 group-hover:text-accent text-sm md:text-base">Gói Kimono</span>
                </a>
                
                <a href="#gallery" class="group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 md:py-3 rounded-full border border-gray-200 hover:border-accent hover:bg-red-50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
                    <span class="text-xl">📍</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-gray-600 group-hover:text-accent text-sm md:text-base">Bộ sưu tập</span>
                </a>

                <a href="#flow" class="group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 md:py-3 rounded-full border border-gray-200 hover:border-accent hover:bg-red-50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
                    <span class="text-xl">🔄</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-gray-600 group-hover:text-accent text-sm md:text-base">Quy trình</span>
                </a>

                <a href="#faq" class="group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 md:py-3 rounded-full border border-gray-200 hover:border-accent hover:bg-red-50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
                    <span class="text-xl">❓</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-gray-600 group-hover:text-accent text-sm md:text-base">Hỏi đáp</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
        <section id="plans" class="py-20 px-5">
            <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                <div class="text-center mb-16">
                    <span class="text-accent font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Lựa chọn phổ biến</span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-main">Các Gói Kimono</h2>
                    <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gold mx-auto mt-6"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
                    <% plans.forEach(plan => { %>
                        <div class="group bg-white rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_10px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition duration-500 border border-gray-100 flex flex-col">
                            
                            <div class="relative h-[320px] overflow-hidden group/slider">
                                <div class="swiper planSwiper w-full h-full">
                                    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                                        
                                        <% if (plan.images && plan.images.length > 0) { %>
                                            <% plan.images.forEach(imgLink => { %>
                                                <div class="swiper-slide">
                                                    <img src="<%= imgLink %>" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top transition duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-110" alt="<%= plan.title %>">
                                                </div>
                                            <% }) %>
                                        <% } else { %>
                                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                                <img src="<%= plan.image %>" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top transition duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-110" alt="<%= plan.title %>">
                                            </div>
                                        <% } %>

                                    </div>
                                    
                                    <div class="swiper-button-next !w-8 !h-8 !bg-white/80 !rounded-full !text-main !text-xs after:!text-xs opacity-0 group-hover/slider:opacity-100 transition shadow-md"></div>
                                    <div class="swiper-button-prev !w-8 !h-8 !bg-white/80 !rounded-full !text-main !text-xs after:!text-xs opacity-0 group-hover/slider:opacity-100 transition shadow-md"></div>
                                    
                                    <div class="swiper-pagination !bottom-2"></div>
                                </div>

                                <% if(plan.tag) { %>
                                    <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 z-10 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur text-accent px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold shadow-sm uppercase tracking-wider">
                                        <%= plan.tag %>
                                    </div>
                                <% } %>
                            </div>
                                                        
                            <div class="p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col">
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 font-serif text-gray-800"><%= plan.title %></h3>
                                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-4">
                                    <span class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold font-serif">¥<%= plan.price.toLocaleString() %></span>
                                    <span class="text-sm line-through text-gray-400">¥<%= plan.originalPrice.toLocaleString() %></span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1"><%= plan.desc %></p>
                                
                                <a href="/plan/<%= plan.id %>" class="block w-full text-center py-3 border border-main text-main rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-main hover:text-white transition duration-300">
                                    Xem chi tiết
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    <% }); %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="flow" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#fdfbf7]">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <span class="text-accent font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Dễ dàng & Tiện lợi</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-main">Quy Trình Thuê Kimono</h2>
                <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gold mx-auto mt-6"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 relative hover:-translate-y-2 transition duration-300">
                    <div class="absolute -top-5 -left-5 w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-lg">1</div>
                    <div class="h-16 w-16 bg-red-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto text-3xl">📅</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-center mb-3">Đặt Chỗ & Đến Tiệm</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">Đặt lịch trước qua web để giữ chỗ. Đến tiệm tay không, không cần mang theo gì cả!</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 relative hover:-translate-y-2 transition duration-300">
                    <div class="absolute -top-5 -left-5 w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-lg">2</div>
                    <div class="h-16 w-16 bg-red-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto text-3xl">👘</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-center mb-3">Chọn & Mặc Kimono</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">Chọn bộ Kimono ưng ý từ 20,000 mẫu. Chuyên gia sẽ giúp bạn mặc đẹp chuẩn Nhật Bản (khoảng 20p).</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 relative hover:-translate-y-2 transition duration-300">
                    <div class="absolute -top-5 -left-5 w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-lg">3</div>
                    <div class="h-16 w-16 bg-red-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto text-3xl">💄</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-center mb-3">Làm Tóc & Phụ Kiện</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">Tạo kiểu tóc chuyên nghiệp miễn phí/trả phí. Chọn túi xách, guốc gỗ (Geta) phù hợp.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 relative hover:-translate-y-2 transition duration-300">
                    <div class="absolute -top-5 -left-5 w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-lg">4</div>
                    <div class="h-16 w-16 bg-red-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto text-3xl">📸</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-center mb-3">Dạo Phố & Chụp Ảnh</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">Tự do khám phá phố cổ, chụp những bức ảnh để đời. Gửi hành lý lại tiệm an toàn.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 relative hover:-translate-y-2 transition duration-300">
                    <div class="absolute -top-5 -left-5 w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-lg">5</div>
                    <div class="h-16 w-16 bg-red-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto text-3xl">↩️</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-center mb-3">Trả Đồ</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">Quay lại tiệm trả đồ trước giờ đóng cửa (hoặc chọn gói trả vào ngày hôm sau/trả tại khách sạn).</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-accent to-red-800 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-white text-center transform scale-105">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Sẵn sàng chưa?</h3>
                    <p class="text-white/80 mb-6 text-sm">Đặt lịch ngay để nhận ưu đãi giảm giá online!</p>
                    <a href="/booking-step1" class="bg-white text-accent px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-gray-100 transition w-full">ĐẶT LỊCH NGAY</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="gallery" class="py-20 px-5 bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
            <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                <div class="text-center mb-16">
                    <span class="text-accent font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Thư viện ảnh</span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-main">Khách Hàng Của Chúng Tôi</h2>
                    
                    <a href="https://instagram.com/wargo_kimono" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-3 text-gray-500 hover:text-accent transition group">
                        <img src="https://static.kyotokimonorental.com/app/img/icon/icon-instagram.webp" class="w-6 h-6 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition">
                        <span class="font-medium">@wargo_kimono</span>
                    </a>
                    
                    <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gold mx-auto mt-6"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 md:gap-6">
                    <% galleryImages.forEach(img => { %>
                        <div class="group relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition duration-500">
                            <img src="<%= img %>" 
                                 class="w-full h-full object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" 
                                 loading="lazy" 
                                 alt="Khách hàng mặc Kimono">
                            
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-300 flex items-center justify-center">
                                <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/50 text-sm font-bold flex items-center gap-2 transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition duration-300 delay-75">
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500">
                                        <path d="M11.645 20.91l-.007-.003-.022-.012a15.247 15.247 0 01-.383-.218 25.18 25.18 0 01-4.244-3.17C4.688 15.36 2.25 12.174 2.25 8.25 2.25 5.322 4.714 3 7.5 3c1.76 0 3.31.81 4.505 2.224A6.002 6.002 0 0116.5 3c2.786 0 5.25 2.322 5.25 5.25 0 3.925-2.438 7.111-4.739 9.256a25.175 25.175 0 01-4.244 3.17 15.247 15.247 0 01-.383.219l-.022.012-.007.004-.003.001a.752.752 0 01-.704 0l-.003-.001z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    Xem ảnh
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    <% }) %>
                </div>

                <div class="text-center mt-12">
                    <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" class="inline-block border border-main text-main px-10 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-main hover:text-white transition duration-300">
                        Xem thêm bộ sưu tập →
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-main">Vị trí cửa hàng</h2>
            <p class="text-sub1 mt-2">Hãy ghé thăm chúng tôi để trải nghiệm dịch vụ tốt nhất</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
            
            <div class="bg-bgBase p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm h-full">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent mb-4"><%= shops[0].name %></h3>
                
                <div class="space-y-4 text-main">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <span class="text-2xl">📍</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold">Địa chỉ:</p>
                            <p class="text-sub1"><%= shops[0].address %></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <span class="text-2xl">⏰</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold">Giờ mở cửa:</p>
                            <p class="text-sub1">09:00 - 18:00 (Hàng ngày)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <span class="text-2xl">📞</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold">Hotline:</p>
                            <p class="text-sub1"><a href="tel:0901234567" class="hover:text-accent">090-1234-5678</a></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-8">
                    <a href="/booking-step1" class="block w-full text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-[#BA2636] text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-full shadow-md hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition">
                        ĐẶT LỊCH NGAY TẠI ĐÂY
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg h-[400px] border border-gray-200 relative group">
                <iframe 
                    src="<%= shops[0].mapEmbed %>" 
                    width="100%" 
                    height="100%" 
                    style="border:0;" 
                    allowfullscreen="" 
                    loading="lazy" 
                    referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
                    class="w-full h-full grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition duration-500">
                </iframe>
                
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 group-hover:bg-transparent pointer-events-none transition"></div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
    </main>
<section id="faq" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <span class="text-accent font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Trợ giúp</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-main">Câu Hỏi Thường Gặp</h2>
                <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gold mx-auto mt-6"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <details class="group bg-bgBase rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-white open:shadow-lg open:ring-1 open:ring-black/5 transition-all duration-300">
                    <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-lg text-main list-none">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="text-accent text-xl">Q.</span>
                            Hủy lịch có mất phí không?
                        </span>
                        <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-400">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
                            </svg>
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base pl-8 border-l-2 border-accent/20">
                        <p>Hủy trước 2 ngày: <strong>Miễn phí</strong>.<br>Hủy trước 1 ngày hoặc trong ngày: <strong>100% phí</strong>.<br>Vui lòng liên hệ sớm nhất có thể nếu bạn thay đổi kế hoạch.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="group bg-bgBase rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-white open:shadow-lg open:ring-1 open:ring-black/5 transition-all duration-300">
                    <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-lg text-main list-none">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="text-accent text-xl">Q.</span>
                            Tôi cần mang theo gì khi đến cửa hàng?
                        </span>
                        <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-400">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
                            </svg>
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base pl-8 border-l-2 border-accent/20">
                        <p>Bạn không cần mang theo bất cứ thứ gì! Gói thuê của chúng tôi đã bao gồm đầy đủ: Kimono, đai lưng (Obi), túi xách, guốc gỗ (Geta) và làm tóc cơ bản.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

